.TH ABUSE 6 "August 2026" "Abuse 1.0.5" "Games Manual"
.SH NAME
abuse \- dark 2D side-scrolling run-and-gun game
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B abuse
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B Abuse
is an SDL port of the 1995 run-and-gun game. The package includes the
original campaign, multiplayer levels, add-ons, music, and sound effects.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-size " width height"
Set the framebuffer size.
.TP
.BI \-a " addon"
Use the named add-on.
.TP
.BI \-f " map"
Load the named map file.
.TP
.B \-lisp
Start in Lisp interpreter mode.
.TP
.B \-nodelay
Run at maximum speed.
.TP
.BI \-datadir " directory"
Use the specified game-data directory.
.TP
.B \-fullscreen
Enable borderless desktop fullscreen mode.
.TP
.B \-widescreen
Expand the framebuffer to the desktop aspect ratio.
.TP
.B \-no-widescreen
Use the configured framebuffer size exactly.
.TP
.B \-antialias
Enable linear texture filtering.
.TP
.B \-mono
Disable stereo sound.
.TP
.B \-nosound
Disable sound.
.TP
.BI \-scale " factor"
Scale the display by the specified factor.
.TP
.BR \-h , " " \-\-help
Show command-line help and exit.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/abuse/settings.toml
Per-user settings.
.TP
.I /usr/share/abuse
Game data installed by the package.
.SH HOMEPAGE
https://github.com/metinc/abuse
